      "end_ms": 286160,
      "start": "00:04:40.080",
      "end": "00:04:46.160",
      "text": "in the world to most people. And if"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 282800,
      "end_ms": 289360,
      "start": "00:04:42.800",
      "end": "00:04:49.360",
      "text": "you're not capable of doing what the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 286160,
      "end_ms": 290199,
      "start": "00:04:46.160",
      "end": "00:04:50.199",
      "text": "people above you do before you reach"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 289360,
      "end_ms": 294600,
      "start": "00:04:49.360",
      "end": "00:04:54.600",
      "text": "that"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 290199,
      "end_ms": 296720,
      "start": "00:04:50.199",
      "end": "00:04:56.720",
      "text": "level, you are not ready for that"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 294600,
      "end_ms": 298479,
      "start": "00:04:54.600",
      "end": "00:04:58.479",
      "text": "level. Now, I don't know how much longer"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 296720,
      "end_ms": 302000,
      "start": "00:04:56.720",
      "end": "00:05:02.000",
      "text": "I'm going to ramble about this because"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 298479,
      "end_ms": 304240,
      "start": "00:04:58.479",
      "end": "00:05:04.240",
      "text": "that's the main point. Um, the sentence"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 302000,
      "end_ms": 307680,
      "start": "00:05:02.000",
      "end": "00:05:07.680",
      "text": "I started the video off with was you're"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 304240,
      "end_ms": 309400,
      "start": "00:05:04.240",
      "end": "00:05:09.400",
      "text": "not trying that hard. And what I mean is"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 307680,
      "end_ms": 312320,
      "start": "00:05:07.680",
      "end": "00:05:12.320",
      "text": "no matter how hard you think you're"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 309400,
      "end_ms": 313840,
      "start": "00:05:09.400",
      "end": "00:05:13.840",
      "text": "trying, if you have stagnated somewhere"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 312320,
      "end_ms": 315919,
      "start": "00:05:12.320",
      "end": "00:05:15.919",
      "text": "and you feel like you're stuck in a"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 313840,
      "end_ms": 318560,
      "start": "00:05:13.840",
      "end": "00:05:18.560",
      "text": "loop, you're stuck in the matrix, and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 315919,
      "end_ms": 321680,
      "start": "00:05:15.919",
      "end": "00:05:21.680",
      "text": "you feel like the reason I'm not"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 318560,
      "end_ms": 324000,
      "start": "00:05:18.560",
      "end": "00:05:24.000",
      "text": "improving is because the system or"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 321680,
      "end_ms": 326720,
      "start": "00:05:21.680",
      "end": "00:05:26.720",
      "text": "because the people above me are keeping"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 324000,
      "end_ms": 328919,
      "start": "00:05:24.000",
      "end": "00:05:28.919",
      "text": "me down or something is holding me back."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 326720,
      "end_ms": 333600,
      "start": "00:05:26.720",
      "end": "00:05:33.600",
      "text": "You're wrong."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 328919,
      "end_ms": 336720,
      "start": "00:05:28.919",
      "end": "00:05:36.720",
      "text": "And more importantly, the mindset that I"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 333600,
      "end_ms": 338960,
      "start": "00:05:33.600",
      "end": "00:05:38.960",
      "text": "would try that hard if only they would"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 336720,
      "end_ms": 341600,
      "start": "00:05:36.720",
      "end": "00:05:41.600",
      "text": "take a chance on me or if only I would"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 338960,
      "end_ms": 343759,
      "start": "00:05:38.960",
      "end": "00:05:43.759",
      "text": "be given the opportunity. I could try"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 341600,
      "end_ms": 348240,
      "start": "00:05:41.600",
      "end": "00:05:48.240",
      "text": "that hard. I would try that hard. You"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 343759,
      "end_ms": 350560,
      "start": "00:05:43.759",
      "end": "00:05:50.560",
      "text": "won't because you'll do what you want to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 348240,
      "end_ms": 352479,
      "start": "00:05:48.240",
      "end": "00:05:52.479",
      "text": "do and are capable of doing. And if you"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 350560,
      "end_ms": 354400,
      "start": "00:05:50.560",
      "end": "00:05:54.400",
      "text": "were capable of doing it and you did"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 352479,
      "end_ms": 356560,
      "start": "00:05:52.479",
      "end": "00:05:56.560",
      "text": "want to do it, you would already be"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 354400,
      "end_ms": 359520,
      "start": "00:05:54.400",
      "end": "00:05:59.520",
      "text": "doing it. Everyone would see it."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 356560,
      "end_ms": 361440,
      "start": "00:05:56.560",
      "end": "00:06:01.440",
      "text": "Everyone would know it."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 359520,
      "end_ms": 363560,
      "start": "00:05:59.520",
      "end": "00:06:03.560",
      "text": "and you wouldn't need to be given the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 361440,
      "end_ms": 365960,
      "start": "00:06:01.440",
      "end": "00:06:05.960",
      "text": "opportunity because you would take"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 363560,
      "end_ms": 368919,
      "start": "00:06:03.560",
      "end": "00:06:08.919",
      "text": "it. And that's important. That's the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 365960,
      "end_ms": 373440,
      "start": "00:06:05.960",
      "end": "00:06:13.440",
      "text": "takeaway."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 368919,
      "end_ms": 374680,
      "start": "00:06:08.919",
      "end": "00:06:14.680",
      "text": "Um, I do want to say that it's harsh."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 373440,
      "end_ms": 378080,
      "start": "00:06:13.440",
      "end": "00:06:18.080",
      "text": "It's very"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 374680,
      "end_ms": 380960,
      "start": "00:06:14.680",
      "end": "00:06:20.960",
      "text": "absolutist. There might be extreme"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 378080,
      "end_ms": 382639,
      "start": "00:06:18.080",
      "end": "00:06:22.639",
      "text": "situations in your unique circumstance"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 380960,
      "end_ms": 384240,
      "start": "00:06:20.960",
      "end": "00:06:24.240",
      "text": "that do make you different from everyone"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 382639,
      "end_ms": 387759,
      "start": "00:06:22.639",
      "end": "00:06:27.759",
      "text": "else. But the important thing is that"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 384240,
      "end_ms": 391280,
      "start": "00:06:24.240",
      "end": "00:06:31.280",
      "text": "that doesn't matter. If you want to get"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 387759,
      "end_ms": 394199,
      "start": "00:06:27.759",
      "end": "00:06:34.199",
      "text": "better at something, especially if you"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 391280,
      "end_ms": 396280,
      "start": "00:06:31.280",
      "end": "00:06:36.280",
      "text": "want to be the best at"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 394199,
      "end_ms": 398600,
      "start": "00:06:34.199",
      "end": "00:06:38.600",
      "text": "something, you need"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 396280,
      "end_ms": 403479,
      "start": "00:06:36.280",
      "end": "00:06:43.479",
      "text": "to be"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 398600,
      "end_ms": 407120,
      "start": "00:06:38.600",
      "end": "00:06:47.120",
      "text": "honest with how much you're"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 403479,
      "end_ms": 409039,
      "start": "00:06:43.479",
      "end": "00:06:49.039",
      "text": "wasting. And this is specifically for"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 407120,
      "end_ms": 410800,
      "start": "00:06:47.120",
      "end": "00:06:50.800",
      "text": "people that have ambitions, right? If"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 409039,
      "end_ms": 412800,
      "start": "00:06:49.039",
      "end": "00:06:52.800",
      "text": "you don't have ambitions, if your goal"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 410800,
      "end_ms": 414800,
      "start": "00:06:50.800",
      "end": "00:06:54.800",
      "text": "is to have fun, there's nothing wrong"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 412800,
      "end_ms": 418319,
      "start": "00:06:52.800",
      "end": "00:06:58.319",
      "text": "with that. That's totally fine. and this"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 414800,
      "end_ms": 420800,
      "start": "00:06:54.800",
      "end": "00:07:00.800",
      "text": "isn't for you. I'm only harsh towards"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 418319,
      "end_ms": 424080,
      "start": "00:06:58.319",
      "end": "00:07:04.080",
      "text": "people that claim to have those"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 420800,
      "end_ms": 427319,
      "start": "00:07:00.800",
      "end": "00:07:07.319",
      "text": "ambitions and don't do anything about"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 424080,
      "end_ms": 432160,
      "start": "00:07:04.080",
      "end": "00:07:12.160",
      "text": "them. Because if you are doing"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 427319,
      "end_ms": 434599,
      "start": "00:07:07.319",
      "end": "00:07:14.599",
      "text": "something for four or more hours a day,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 432160,
      "end_ms": 437919,
      "start": "00:07:12.160",
      "end": "00:07:17.919",
      "text": "that is a part-time job or"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 434599,
      "end_ms": 440720,
      "start": "00:07:14.599",
      "end": "00:07:20.720",
      "text": "more worth of what you're doing. That's"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 437919,
      "end_ms": 444080,
      "start": "00:07:17.919",
      "end": "00:07:24.080",
      "text": "a significant part of your life. And if"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 440720,
      "end_ms": 445919,
      "start": "00:07:20.720",
      "end": "00:07:25.919",
      "text": "you are holding on to that excuse and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 444080,
      "end_ms": 449120,
      "start": "00:07:24.080",
      "end": "00:07:29.120",
      "text": "that little bit of hope that says one"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 445919,
      "end_ms": 452000,
      "start": "00:07:25.919",
      "end": "00:07:32.000",
      "text": "day I'll get lucky and I'll get given"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 449120,
      "end_ms": 455039,
      "start": "00:07:29.120",
      "end": "00:07:35.039",
      "text": "that special opportunity and then I'll"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 452000,
      "end_ms": 457360,
      "start": "00:07:32.000",
      "end": "00:07:37.360",
      "text": "start using my time wisely. Then you're"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 455039,
      "end_ms": 459880,
      "start": "00:07:35.039",
      "end": "00:07:39.880",
      "text": "wasting all of your time because you're"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 457360,
      "end_ms": 463280,
      "start": "00:07:37.360",
      "end": "00:07:43.280",
      "text": "already spending your time doing this. I"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 459880,
      "end_ms": 467560,
      "start": "00:07:39.880",
      "end": "00:07:47.560",
      "text": "know players, I know competitors that"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 463280,
      "end_ms": 470800,
      "start": "00:07:43.280",
      "end": "00:07:50.800",
      "text": "spend eight hours a day playing some"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 467560,
      "end_ms": 472639,
      "start": "00:07:47.560",
      "end": "00:07:52.639",
      "text": "game, whether it's I do this amount of"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 470800,
      "end_ms": 474160,
      "start": "00:07:50.800",
      "end": "00:07:54.160",
      "text": "scrims and I do this amount of just"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 472639,
      "end_ms": 476319,
      "start": "00:07:52.639",
      "end": "00:07:56.319",
      "text": "playing ranked and I play with my"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 474160,
      "end_ms": 477840,
      "start": "00:07:54.160",
      "end": "00:07:57.840",
      "text": "friends and and all that stuff, and you"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 476319,
      "end_ms": 480560,
      "start": "00:07:56.319",
      "end": "00:08:00.560",
      "text": "say to yourself, \"Well, I'm not taking"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 477840,
      "end_ms": 482479,
      "start": "00:07:57.840",
      "end": "00:08:02.479",
      "text": "it that seriously.\" Yes, you are. It's"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 480560,
      "end_ms": 484599,
      "start": "00:08:00.560",
      "end": "00:08:04.599",
      "text": "your life."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 482479,
      "end_ms": 488479,
      "start": "00:08:02.479",
      "end": "00:08:08.479",
      "text": "understand"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 484599,
      "end_ms": 490960,
      "start": "00:08:04.599",
      "end": "00:08:10.960",
      "text": "that if you were honest about how much"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 488479,
      "end_ms": 493199,
      "start": "00:08:08.479",
      "end": "00:08:13.199",
      "text": "this controls you and how much it means"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 490960,
      "end_ms": 496720,
      "start": "00:08:10.960",
      "end": "00:08:16.720",
      "text": "to you and you were willing to stop"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 493199,
      "end_ms": 498400,
      "start": "00:08:13.199",
      "end": "00:08:18.400",
      "text": "hiding behind the shield of it doesn't"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 496720,
      "end_ms": 499919,
      "start": "00:08:16.720",
      "end": "00:08:19.919",
      "text": "mean that much to me. I'm not really"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 498400,
      "end_ms": 501720,
      "start": "00:08:18.400",
      "end": "00:08:21.720",
      "text": "trying that hard. I don't actually"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 499919,
      "end_ms": 503639,
      "start": "00:08:19.919",
      "end": "00:08:23.639",
      "text": "really want this that"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 501720,
      "end_ms": 507680,
      "start": "00:08:21.720",
      "end": "00:08:27.680",
      "text": "badly."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 503639,
      "end_ms": 509520,
      "start": "00:08:23.639",
      "end": "00:08:29.520",
      "text": "Then you can grasp what it takes to get"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 507680,
      "end_ms": 511280,
      "start": "00:08:27.680",
      "end": "00:08:31.280",
      "text": "to the next level. People will be"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 509520,
      "end_ms": 513159,
      "start": "00:08:29.520",
      "end": "00:08:33.159",
      "text": "willing to help you. People will be"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 511280,
      "end_ms": 516000,
      "start": "00:08:31.280",
      "end": "00:08:36.000",
      "text": "willing to try and give you"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 513159,
      "end_ms": 519680,
      "start": "00:08:33.159",
      "end": "00:08:39.680",
      "text": "opportunities if you show you are"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 516000,
      "end_ms": 521599,
      "start": "00:08:36.000",
      "end": "00:08:41.599",
      "text": "already ready for it. And I think I'm"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 519680,
      "end_ms": 523200,
      "start": "00:08:39.680",
      "end": "00:08:43.200",
      "text": "going to end the video here. I've"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 521599,
      "end_ms": 525200,
      "start": "00:08:41.599",
      "end": "00:08:45.200",
      "text": "rambled on long enough. How long has"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 523200,
      "end_ms": 529080,
      "start": "00:08:43.200",
      "end": "00:08:49.080",
      "text": "this been? Eight minutes. Eight minute"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 525200,
      "end_ms": 533360,
      "start": "00:08:45.200",
      "end": "00:08:53.360",
      "text": "video. It's pretty short."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 529080,
      "end_ms": 535680,
      "start": "00:08:49.080",
      "end": "00:08:55.680",
      "text": "Um, I left this kind of vague because"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 533360,
      "end_ms": 539440,
      "start": "00:08:53.360",
      "end": "00:08:59.440",
      "text": "um, I am a professional or I was a"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 535680,
      "end_ms": 542959,
      "start": "00:08:55.680",
      "end": "00:09:02.959",
      "text": "professional Overwatch coach, but it's"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 539440,
      "end_ms": 544680,
      "start": "00:08:59.440",
      "end": "00:09:04.680",
      "text": "not a lesson I learned from Overwatch"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 542959,
      "end_ms": 547519,
      "start": "00:09:02.959",
      "end": "00:09:07.519",
      "text": "and it's not a lesson you're going to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 544680,
      "end_ms": 549600,
      "start": "00:09:04.680",
      "end": "00:09:09.600",
      "text": "learn from what you're doing on your on"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 547519,
      "end_ms": 551440,
      "start": "00:09:07.519",
      "end": "00:09:11.440",
      "text": "your own, you know. It's a lesson that"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 549600,
      "end_ms": 555519,
      "start": "00:09:09.600",
      "end": "00:09:15.519",
      "text": "you learn from looking at the people"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 551440,
      "end_ms": 557040,
      "start": "00:09:11.440",
      "end": "00:09:17.040",
      "text": "around you and seeing who is getting"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 555519,
      "end_ms": 558640,
      "start": "00:09:15.519",
      "end": "00:09:18.640",
      "text": "opportunities and who's really getting"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 557040,
      "end_ms": 560480,
      "start": "00:09:17.040",
      "end": "00:09:20.480",
      "text": "better. You know, if you look at the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 558640,
      "end_ms": 562240,
      "start": "00:09:18.640",
      "end": "00:09:22.240",
      "text": "people around you and you think this"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 560480,
      "end_ms": 563760,
      "start": "00:09:20.480",
      "end": "00:09:23.760",
      "text": "person didn't deserve that, this person"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 562240,
      "end_ms": 566120,
      "start": "00:09:22.240",
      "end": "00:09:26.120",
      "text": "didn't deserve that. I'm better than"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 563760,
      "end_ms": 567640,
      "start": "00:09:23.760",
      "end": "00:09:27.640",
      "text": "this person. I was better than this"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 566120,
      "end_ms": 571120,
      "start": "00:09:26.120",
      "end": "00:09:31.120",
      "text": "person."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 567640,
      "end_ms": 572800,
      "start": "00:09:27.640",
      "end": "00:09:32.800",
      "text": "Um, one, you're probably wrong and not"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 571120,
      "end_ms": 574320,
      "start": "00:09:31.120",
      "end": "00:09:34.320",
      "text": "objective because things don't really"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 572800,
      "end_ms": 575760,
      "start": "00:09:32.800",
      "end": "00:09:35.760",
      "text": "happen that way most of the time."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 574320,
      "end_ms": 577360,
      "start": "00:09:34.320",
      "end": "00:09:37.360",
      "text": "Occasionally they do and occasionally"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 575760,
      "end_ms": 578640,
      "start": "00:09:35.760",
      "end": "00:09:38.640",
      "text": "you're right, but on a grand scale"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 577360,
      "end_ms": 581560,
      "start": "00:09:37.360",
      "end": "00:09:41.560",
      "text": "you're wrong. That's not how things"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 578640,
      "end_ms": 584720,
      "start": "00:09:38.640",
      "end": "00:09:44.720",
      "text": "work, right?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 581560,
      "end_ms": 587760,
      "start": "00:09:41.560",
      "end": "00:09:47.760",
      "text": "Because it's just not like you have to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 584720,
      "end_ms": 590040,
      "start": "00:09:44.720",
      "end": "00:09:50.040",
      "text": "trust me on that, unfortunately. Um,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 587760,
      "end_ms": 593560,
      "start": "00:09:47.760",
      "end": "00:09:53.560",
      "text": "yeah, I'm going to end the video."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 590040,
      "end_ms": 595560,
      "start": "00:09:50.040",
      "end": "00:09:55.560",
      "text": "Um, I will say before I"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 593560,
      "end_ms": 597959,
      "start": "00:09:53.560",
      "end": "00:09:57.959",
      "text": "end, if"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 595560,
      "end_ms": 601720,
      "start": "00:09:55.560",
      "end": "00:10:01.720",
      "text": "you take"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 597959,
      "end_ms": 605160,
      "start": "00:09:57.959",
      "end": "00:10:05.160",
      "text": "control of your own situation and you"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 601720,
      "end_ms": 608080,
      "start": "00:10:01.720",
      "end": "00:10:08.080",
      "text": "think I'm a tier three, whatever"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 605160,
      "end_ms": 612399,
      "start": "00:10:05.160",
      "end": "00:10:12.399",
      "text": "competitor, I want to reach the tier"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 608080,
      "end_ms": 614959,
      "start": "00:10:08.080",
      "end": "00:10:14.959",
      "text": "above me. I'm going to do what those"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 612399,
      "end_ms": 617600,
      "start": "00:10:12.399",
      "end": "00:10:17.600",
      "text": "people do and pretend I'm in that tier"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 614959,
      "end_ms": 619680,
      "start": "00:10:14.959",
      "end": "00:10:19.680",
      "text": "and I'm going to think if I was gifted"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 617600,
      "end_ms": 622160,
      "start": "00:10:17.600",
      "end": "00:10:22.160",
      "text": "that opportunity right now, a miracle"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 619680,
      "end_ms": 624880,
      "start": "00:10:19.680",
      "end": "00:10:24.880",
      "text": "opportunity that is lucky and that I"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 622160,
      "end_ms": 628480,
      "start": "00:10:22.160",
      "end": "00:10:28.480",
      "text": "probably don't deserve, what would I do?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 624880,
      "end_ms": 630000,
      "start": "00:10:24.880",
      "end": "00:10:30.000",
      "text": "Put yourself in that mindset. If I'm an"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 628480,
      "end_ms": 632680,
      "start": "00:10:28.480",
      "end": "00:10:32.680",
      "text": "Overwatch player, I'm a tier three"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 630000,
      "end_ms": 636480,
      "start": "00:10:30.000",
      "end": "00:10:36.480",
      "text": "Overwatch player and I get gifted an"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 632680,
      "end_ms": 639040,
      "start": "00:10:32.680",
      "end": "00:10:39.040",
      "text": "opportunity to be on an incredible team."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 636480,
      "end_ms": 642200,
      "start": "00:10:36.480",
      "end": "00:10:42.200",
      "text": "All the players are better than me. What"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 639040,
      "end_ms": 646720,
      "start": "00:10:39.040",
      "end": "00:10:46.720",
      "text": "would I do? How hard would I"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 642200,
      "end_ms": 648440,
      "start": "00:10:42.200",
      "end": "00:10:48.440",
      "text": "try? How much would I grow? And why am I"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 646720,
      "end_ms": 651040,
      "start": "00:10:46.720",
      "end": "00:10:51.040",
      "text": "not doing that right"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 648440,
      "end_ms": 653680,
      "start": "00:10:48.440",
      "end": "00:10:53.680",
      "text": "now? And that's what I'll leave you"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 651040,
      "end_ms": 657440,
      "start": "00:10:51.040",
      "end": "00:10:57.440",
      "text": "with. Um, like it, leave a comment,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 653680,
      "end_ms": 657440,
      "start": "00:10:53.680",
      "end": "00:10:57.440",
      "text": "subscribe, hit the bell, all that"
    }
  ]
}
